= Pulling MediaWiki Docker Image =

To pull MediaWiki Docker image:

<pre>
$ docker pull mediawiki
</pre>

= Running MediaWiki Container =

To run MediaWiki container:

<pre>
$ docker run -p 8080:80 --link mysql-server:mysql mediawiki
</pre>

To verify, open http://localhost:8080.

